1
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,960
<i>Please, let's start dating, for real.</i>

2
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,680
<i>You don't have to give me an answer right away.</i>

3
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,380
Don't space out on me.

4
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,790
Ai?

5
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:39,220
It's weird…

6
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:45,480
It's like my eyes keep following him…

7
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:48,640
That's love!

8
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:52,430
Love… No way!

9
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:56,600
Then why didn't you spill the beans when he told you his feelings?

10
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,700
Well…

11
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:05,000
You didn't want your time with Reo to end, right?

12
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:08,050
You're wrong!

13
00:01:09,450 --> 00:01:14,740
And, anyway, he told me his feelings about "Mai".

14
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:18,210
I see…

15
00:01:18,210 --> 00:01:20,450
So you, accidentally, fell in love with him?

16
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:22,690
It's not love!

17
00:01:22,690 --> 00:01:24,560
Absolutely not.

18
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:36,700
<i>[Ai-Chan's Secret | Episode 2]</i>

19
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,670
<i>[Maid Cafe | Spica]</i>

20
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,010
You've got to be kidding me…

21
00:01:44,010 --> 00:01:46,420
Someone like Reo?

22
00:01:50,570 --> 00:01:54,180
My little sister really became a woman! Should I make red rice to celebrate?
<i>(T/N: The red color of the rice symbolizes happiness and prosperity)</i>

23
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:57,830
Go die. And then apologize to all the little sisters of the world.

24
00:01:57,830 --> 00:01:59,120
Want some hotel recommendations?

25
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:02,670
Stop making me repeat myself! I spend the night at Hiroko's!

26
00:02:02,670 --> 00:02:05,180
Hiroko, right…

27
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:07,090
Pig-headed jerk!

28
00:02:08,990 --> 00:02:13,390
You've killed it. You've killed the mood.

29
00:02:13,390 --> 00:02:16,760
I'm popular as Aiko too, you know!

30
00:02:17,770 --> 00:02:20,870
Don't you want to win? Against the guys?

31
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:25,160
If it's a game, of course I want to win.

32
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:28,010
Then lock Aiko away!

33
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:32,270
This is your greatest weapon.

34
00:02:33,130 --> 00:02:37,340
Customers come to enjoy a dream, like their own little soap bubble.

35
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:41,730
It's against the rules for you to pop the bubble and end the game.

36
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:49,380
Is Mai… really that great?

37
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:51,520
Mai is an angel!

38
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:54,970
But Aiko is…

39
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:59,990
Come on! What's your deal? Go over there!

40
00:02:59,990 --> 00:03:01,800
<i>[Maid Cafe | Spica]</i>

41
00:03:07,070 --> 00:03:10,460
So, did you tell Aiko? About us?

42
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:12,630
No, not yet.

43
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:15,220
It doesn't seem like the right time.

44
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:21,570
You seem kind of down today, Mai.

45
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:24,180
Listen…

46
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:27,560
What do you think about me?

47
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:30,130
What do I think?

48
00:03:30,130 --> 00:03:33,760
You're super cute.

49
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,340
- I see...
- Huh?

50
00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:41,510
That makes you depressed? It was a compliment!

51
00:03:45,250 --> 00:03:47,150
Thank you.

52
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:52,220
All right! Want to play a board game, Master?

53
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,870
Are you waiting for him to text you?

54
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:21,700
I'm not waiting for it!

55
00:04:22,330 --> 00:04:25,140
Why not text first? Say you want to see him.

56
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:27,240
Why would I do that?

57
00:04:55,140 --> 00:04:58,380
<i>[Are you free to meet up now? I want to see you]</i>

58
00:04:58,380 --> 00:04:59,860
Want me to lend you some clothes?

59
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,680
Are you sure?

60
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:12,280
Want to get something to eat?

61
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:16,980
Man, I'm starving!

62
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:18,350
I am too.

63
00:05:18,350 --> 00:05:20,270
Let's get grilled meat!

64
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:21,330
- Noodles!
- Meat!

65
00:05:21,330 --> 00:05:23,640
- Noodles!
- Meat!

66
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:32,480
You'd make a high schooler treat you to meat?

67
00:05:33,470 --> 00:05:36,850
You were the one who invited me, right?

68
00:05:40,530 --> 00:05:42,880
Someone must have forgotten it.

69
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:52,760
Why not decide what to eat with an impartial game?

70
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,350
Fine by me.

71
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:57,370
But I won't lose.

72
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,610
I don't know about that.

73
00:06:11,130 --> 00:06:17,780
♫ <i>Just wanna, wanna, wanna, wanna go and take it</i> ♫

74
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:22,570
- You're really good.
- You think so?

75
00:06:22,570 --> 00:06:24,960
- You like basketball?
- I do.

76
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:27,560
What about me?

77
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,830
What?

78
00:06:32,430 --> 00:06:35,600
♫ <i>You are suspicion</i> ♫

79
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:38,900
No fair! You caught me off guard.

80
00:06:44,410 --> 00:06:46,850
Do you see me as a man?

81
00:06:46,850 --> 00:06:48,890
Probably.

82
00:06:48,890 --> 00:06:51,760
I look at you differently than other guys.

83
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:55,310
<i>[I look at you differently than other guys]</i>

84
00:06:55,310 --> 00:07:02,360
♫ <i>Just wanna, wanna, wanna, wanna go and take it</i> ♫

85
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:04,930
I did it!

86
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:14,070
You're fast, Mai.

87
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:16,380
I couldn't catch up to you at all.

88
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:20,140
Have you played basketball before?

89
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:22,960
Were you playing seriously?

90
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,800
Of course.

91
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,970
You're not even breathing hard.

92
00:07:26,970 --> 00:07:28,950
I lost.

93
00:07:28,950 --> 00:07:32,260
I'll treat you to some meat.

94
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:36,630
I see…

95
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:45,430
You went easy on me?

96
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:50,540
No, you won.

97
00:07:54,170 --> 00:07:57,630
You never went easy on me before…

98
00:07:59,190 --> 00:08:01,570
<i>You got sloppy at the end, Aiko.</i>

99
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:05,320
You only do that to girls you like, huh…

100
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,100
<i>Please </i>

101
00:08:07,930 --> 00:08:10,450
let's start dating, for real.

102
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:16,250
You didn't just let the girl you like

103
00:08:16,250 --> 00:08:19,860
steal the ball that easily.

104
00:08:21,950 --> 00:08:24,780
The person you fell in love with

105
00:08:30,590 --> 00:08:33,940
is Aiko, the girl you always tease!

106
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:43,300
I never thought you were such a coward.

107
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:47,220
This game is over.

108
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:50,750
I knew it was you.

109
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:54,790
I knew everything from the start.

110
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:01,020
Aiko, I…

111
00:09:02,370 --> 00:09:04,730
I thought I was tricking you,

112
00:09:05,590 --> 00:09:08,200
but I was the one being tricked.

113
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,650
No, I wanted to—

114
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:15,690
Wait. Aiko!

115
00:09:20,690 --> 00:09:23,470
Yep. Perfect!

116
00:09:26,030 --> 00:09:28,610
- Oh!
- Oh, nothing! This is for Aiko.

117
00:09:28,610 --> 00:09:32,800
- It's fine, Stingy!
- Isn't your girlfriend waiting? You should get…

118
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:49,640
That was surprising…

119
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,760
- Um...
- Whoa!

120
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:54,300
Is Aiko home?

121
00:09:59,020 --> 00:10:00,350
What's up?

122
00:10:00,350 --> 00:10:02,270
Is the roof leaking?

123
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:07,770
Aiko's arguing with a boy!

124
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:10,490
Ai, Ai...

125
00:10:10,490 --> 00:10:13,430
What's with that reaction? Shouldn't you be more surprised?

126
00:10:13,430 --> 00:10:15,160
Ranji, your girlfriend!

127
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:17,830
Crap! Text me what happens next!

128
00:10:21,270 --> 00:10:25,460
Makes sense. Aiko is around that age, huh?

129
00:10:25,460 --> 00:10:29,110
Yeah, but don't think about making red rice.

130
00:10:29,110 --> 00:10:31,270
She'll kill you.

131
00:10:32,750 --> 00:10:35,110
Aiko, please listen to me.

132
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:36,850
Don't just come up here without permission!

133
00:10:36,850 --> 00:10:39,200
Why did you reveal the truth in such a rushed way?

134
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:42,730
I mean, you just changed your hair. Of course I realized it was you.

135
00:10:44,090 --> 00:10:46,810
You knew when you confessed to me?

136
00:10:47,860 --> 00:10:49,770
I did.

137
00:10:51,810 --> 00:10:55,300
I bet you laughed at how stupid I was.

138
00:10:59,090 --> 00:11:01,430
Did you have fun?

139
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:05,020
I did, but that's—

140
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:08,310
I wasn't serious about it!

141
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:10,770
<i>You always tease me,</i>

142
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:14,030
<i>so I was going to make you fall in love with me and then dump you.</i>

143
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:17,520
But I lost again.

144
00:11:19,170 --> 00:11:21,440
Bet your satisfied, huh?

145
00:11:22,450 --> 00:11:23,790
What are you talking about?

146
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:27,990
Just go home! I don't want to see your face!

147
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:33,250
<i>Right…</i>

148
00:11:33,250 --> 00:11:35,330
<i>Is that so?</i>

149
00:12:16,770 --> 00:12:18,840
<i>[Kafuu High School]</i>

150
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:42,820
<i>In the beginning, I really was trying to trick him.</i>

151
00:12:42,820 --> 00:12:45,020
But…

152
00:12:45,020 --> 00:12:48,360
when I was with Reo as Mai…

153
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:51,150
it was really fun.

154
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:57,200
But I guess it was different for him.

155
00:12:57,210 --> 00:12:59,780
It makes sense.

156
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:03,030
Just because I put on a wig,

157
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:05,880
there's no way he'd fall in love with me.

158
00:13:10,970 --> 00:13:14,210
What are you doing? That hurts.

159
00:13:14,210 --> 00:13:16,470
You can cry.

160
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:20,210
Why would I cry?

161
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:24,520
When you're so full of love,

162
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:27,180
tears sometimes slip out.

163
00:13:28,090 --> 00:13:32,620
I told you, I don't love that jerk.

164
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:35,270
What are you doing?

165
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:47,450
- Sorry.
- What's up with you, Reo?

166
00:13:47,450 --> 00:13:50,950
Let's go again.

167
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:54,230
That other girl is not coming to get in the way today?

168
00:13:54,230 --> 00:13:57,410
Ai is not coming in today.

169
00:13:57,410 --> 00:14:00,270
Things are pretty quiet without her here.

170
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:03,100
All right, take a 10-minute break!

171
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:05,890
Ms. Oyama, please make me team manager already!

172
00:14:05,890 --> 00:14:08,180
I know I can control them.

173
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:11,700
I'll need to discuss it with Mr. Koike.

174
00:14:14,010 --> 00:14:16,990
Ms. Oyama, it's my turn to pick up my son today.

175
00:14:16,990 --> 00:14:19,080
I have to head out.

176
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:32,490
Let's go.

177
00:14:35,230 --> 00:14:38,760
- I like you.
- I'm sorry.

178
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:41,250
There's already someone I like.

179
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:57,110
- Got another love confession?
- Shut up. Leave me alone.

180
00:14:57,110 --> 00:14:59,140
But she was so cute.

181
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:01,950
- Then why don't you date her?
- I can't.

182
00:15:01,950 --> 00:15:05,090
I'm waiting for my destined soul mate.

183
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,900
<i>The person you fell in love with…</i>

184
00:15:12,190 --> 00:15:15,560
<i>is Aiko, the girl you always tease!</i>

185
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:19,490
You don't wait around for destiny, you reach out and grab it.

186
00:15:22,190 --> 00:15:25,270
Do you have one? A destined soul mate?

187
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:27,340
Who is it?

188
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:34,230
I want to quit being a maid.

189
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:38,960
But it made me so happy to see you being feminine.

190
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:42,030
You just don't want to look for another part-timer.

191
00:15:42,030 --> 00:15:44,560
What a shame.

192
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:47,000
I mean, you.

193
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,010
What about me?

194
00:15:49,710 --> 00:15:52,460
You seemed a lot happier than before.

195
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:55,560
Well, I'll look for a replacement.

196
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:58,990
But until I find one…

197
00:16:00,250 --> 00:16:02,430
What?!

198
00:16:02,430 --> 00:16:05,320
Come back soon!

199
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:09,700
I'm home!

200
00:16:09,700 --> 00:16:12,560
Welcome home!

201
00:16:18,670 --> 00:16:21,810
Long time, no see, Mai.

202
00:16:25,050 --> 00:16:28,520
I hoped I could see you here.

203
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:36,640
He's acting like nothing happened.

204
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:48,720
I'd prefer it if he made me a laughingstock.

205
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,320
Ai.

206
00:16:54,130 --> 00:16:57,860
I'll go take care of their table. Okay?

207
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:02,760
Why doesn't the basketball team have a manager?

208
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,760
Mr. Koike is really picky?

209
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:07,580
I mean, the weekend strength trainings are hell!

210
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:11,130
It'd be better if a girl was training too, at least.

211
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:18,070
Kitauchi, come bring snacks to Saturday's training.

212
00:17:18,070 --> 00:17:21,530
Fine, but what do you want to eat?

213
00:17:21,530 --> 00:17:25,110
So you'd like one of my "if there's any leftovers, I'll punish you" omelet rice?

214
00:17:25,110 --> 00:17:28,120
Coming right up!

215
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:31,890
Would you come too, Mai?

216
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:36,650
I want you to come.

217
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:42,240
- Mai is really busy with college and—
- You have weekends off, right?

218
00:17:43,130 --> 00:17:46,900
- But with her job—
- Right, Mai?

219
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:53,210
You'll come, won't you?

220
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,970
<i>[Kafuu High School]</i>

221
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,430
You should have said no.

222
00:18:01,430 --> 00:18:04,510
That's the 8th time you've said that.

223
00:18:04,510 --> 00:18:07,110
What if the other guys find out about you?

224
00:18:07,110 --> 00:18:10,720
How many times have you asked that?

225
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:12,900
I'm serious.

226
00:18:14,730 --> 00:18:18,970
I can't back down after he asked me like that.

227
00:18:18,970 --> 00:18:21,630
I worry about how much you hate to lose.

228
00:18:21,630 --> 00:18:24,300
That's just my personality.

229
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:27,740
Reo invited you knowing you're really Ai.

230
00:18:27,740 --> 00:18:29,950
If anything happens…

231
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:33,050
Nothing will happen. Well,

232
00:18:33,050 --> 00:18:36,950
if something does happen, that's my punishment for the gamble.

233
00:18:38,650 --> 00:18:43,290
But actually, I'm kind of glad he invited me.

234
00:18:43,970 --> 00:18:48,200
I mean, I even put on clothes like this.

235
00:18:50,700 --> 00:18:52,210
Ai…

236
00:18:52,210 --> 00:18:55,320
I'm pretty stupid, huh?

237
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:04,570
Good work, guys! We brought some snacks!

238
00:19:05,590 --> 00:19:08,720
- Kitauchi, you're incredible!
- Is that the maid Mai?

239
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:10,320
She's super cute!

240
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:13,610
- Just my type.
- Say, which maid cafe is this?

241
00:19:13,610 --> 00:19:16,790
- Spica, by the train station.
- Seriously?

242
00:19:16,790 --> 00:19:19,520
- Let's go next time.
- Yeah, let's go.

243
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,270
We'll get Mai to serve us dessert!

244
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:25,100
- Whoa!
- Here you go.

245
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:32,820
Here, have some donuts.

246
00:19:32,820 --> 00:19:35,590
Thanks!

247
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:38,850
Let's eat!

248
00:19:43,710 --> 00:19:48,590
- Mai is totally adorable.
- I hope Reo introduces her to us!

249
00:19:48,590 --> 00:19:50,590
I didn't think you'd come.

250
00:19:51,870 --> 00:19:53,780
You were the one who told me to come.

251
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:56,750
You don't usually listen to me.

252
00:19:58,660 --> 00:20:02,500
If the rest of them finds out… things will be hard for me.

253
00:20:03,290 --> 00:20:06,020
I can't stop looking at her.

254
00:20:06,020 --> 00:20:08,190
- Don't do that.
- Why not?

255
00:20:08,190 --> 00:20:12,020
- I'm gonna get her first.
- No way.

256
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:17,980
I shouldn't have invited you, after all.

257
00:20:21,970 --> 00:20:25,360
Then I'll go home.

258
00:20:27,060 --> 00:20:30,070
Ai— I mean…

259
00:20:30,070 --> 00:20:31,640
Mai!

260
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:34,630
- What happened?
- What's this about?

261
00:20:34,630 --> 00:20:38,390
Wait! Hold on a second!

262
00:20:38,390 --> 00:20:40,260
I said, wait!

263
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:44,250
- Let go!
- I won't.

264
00:20:44,250 --> 00:20:46,520
Just listen to me for a second.

265
00:20:46,520 --> 00:20:48,760
Please.

266
00:20:49,630 --> 00:20:52,750
- You said you wished you hadn't—
- I didn't want the other guys ogling you!

267
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:55,760
You're too pretty!

268
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:03,060
Do you get what I'm saying?

269
00:21:04,180 --> 00:21:06,270
I don't get it at all!

270
00:21:06,270 --> 00:21:08,560
When I met you at Spica,

271
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:11,500
I acted like I didn't know you, and then I asked you out.

272
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:14,160
But I asked you out

273
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:17,210
because I knew it was you, Aiko.

274
00:21:17,210 --> 00:21:19,130
<i>What's your name?</i>

275
00:21:19,130 --> 00:21:21,360
It wasn't because you were Mai.

276
00:21:22,390 --> 00:21:26,920
I knew you'd go along with the invite to make fun of me.

277
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:29,080
That's what I thought.

278
00:21:30,220 --> 00:21:32,700
<i>But if it meant spending time with you,</i>

279
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:35,540
<i>I didn't care what the reason was.</i>

280
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:45,610
If there was any chance to make you love me,

281
00:21:45,610 --> 00:21:47,590
I didn't care.

282
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:01,560
Look at me.

283
00:22:02,460 --> 00:22:04,280
I can't.

284
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:09,900
You said before that you lost,

285
00:22:15,900 --> 00:22:19,080
but really, you won from the very beginning.

286
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:29,170
<i>You're really good! Say...</i>

287
00:22:29,170 --> 00:22:33,230
<i>Let's join the basketball club together!</i>

288
00:22:35,110 --> 00:22:38,170
<i>I'm Aiko Kasumi.</i>

289
00:22:38,170 --> 00:22:40,200
<i>What's your name?</i>

290
00:22:42,180 --> 00:22:44,150
Because I've...

291
00:22:46,610 --> 00:22:48,890
loved you this whole time, Aiko.

292
00:22:48,890 --> 00:22:51,590
♫ <i>What awaits in this battle of love?</i> ♫

293
00:22:51,590 --> 00:22:54,570
♫ <i>It seems it won't end in a draw</i> ♫

294
00:22:54,570 --> 00:22:57,520
♫ <i>You hated loosing,</i> ♫

295
00:22:57,520 --> 00:23:01,590
♫ <i>So I won't let you go easy on me</i> ♫

296
00:23:06,460 --> 00:23:09,910
♫ <i>I don't wish for anyone to know my secret</i> ♫

297
00:23:09,910 --> 00:23:12,580
Aiko…

298
00:23:12,580 --> 00:23:15,420
Do you love me?

299
00:23:15,420 --> 00:23:16,870
♫ <i>1on1</i> ♫

300
00:23:16,870 --> 00:23:22,900
♫ <i>I make you acting like a kid with just a sweet kiss</i> ♫

301
00:23:23,410 --> 00:23:25,220
Tell me.

302
00:23:25,220 --> 00:23:27,690
♫ <i>Only I know this</i> ♫

303
00:23:28,570 --> 00:23:34,760
♫ <i>Rather than touching, we can melt
into one another's embrace</i> ♫

304
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:36,970
♫ <i>I'll let you get near just to return you like a wave</i> ♫

305
00:23:36,970 --> 00:23:38,920
I love you.

306
00:23:40,450 --> 00:23:45,480
♫ <i>I'll steal you away before anyone gets the chance</i> ♫

307
00:23:45,480 --> 00:23:47,150
♫ <i>Lips to exchange</i> ♫

308
00:23:47,150 --> 00:23:49,350
I love you, Reo.

309
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:53,300
<i>[Next time]
Mai would be a better match for you.</i>

310
00:23:53,300 --> 00:23:54,940
<i>Are we going to date based on a lie?</i>

311
00:23:54,940 --> 00:23:57,690
<i>Take a look. We've got battle-ready soldiers.</i>

312
00:23:57,690 --> 00:24:00,360
<i>We're twins!</i>

313
00:24:00,360 --> 00:24:03,450
<i>I'll be your girlfriend!</i>

314
00:24:03,450 --> 00:24:05,980
<i>I want to date you, Ai, openly and honestly.
[This drama is a work of fiction]</i>
